00:03:30.506 --> 00:03:34.866
Audiences are cleared until the 20th of October, and he is expected to stay about a week.

00:03:35.366 --> 00:03:40.226
Cardinal Cacucci Tarsicio Isau, who saw him on Monday, said the Pope wanted the surgery

00:03:40.226 --> 00:03:45.286
