00:03:45.746 --> 00:03:48.946
A Vatican source told AFP that more tests are looking for spread.

00:03:49.426 --> 00:03:52.906
Secretary of State Cardinal Parolin called the news a bolt from the blue,

00:03:53.286 --> 00:03:58.426
